WEBVTT

00:00:14.610 --> 00:00:16.320
It's still there.

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.580
You can't get a hold of Kukuru?

00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:22.330
<i>She won't pick up the phone.</i>

00:00:22.890 --> 00:00:25.480
Do you know anything?

00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:26.520
<i>No.</i>

00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:27.590
Ah...

00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:31.090
She's not the type to skip work 
without telling anyone.

00:00:31.090 --> 00:00:32.990
I'm a bit worried.

00:00:32.990 --> 00:00:35.050
<i>I'll check her room when I get home.</i>

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:36.740
<i>She might be</i>

00:00:36.740 --> 00:00:37.800
at home.

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:38.590
<i>Please.</i>

00:00:38.590 --> 00:00:41.050
<i>I'll let you know as soon 
as I get in touch with her.</i>

00:00:41.050 --> 00:00:41.970
Okay.

00:00:41.970 --> 00:00:43.400
Thank you.

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:49.480
<b>Misakino Kukuru</b>

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:49.480
<b>Calling...</b>

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:52.030
Is something wrong?

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:54.520
Kukuru's not at work.

00:00:54.520 --> 00:00:55.490
Oh, no!

00:02:57.910 --> 00:03:00.620
